<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>It's Only Love</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">James Marriott</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Don't Tell The Dog</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">3kAJkRc0nBX5USc2QXE8Sz</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:05.690" end="00:07.820">Brand-new apartment</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:07.820" end="00:14.330">Covered in diamonds, dear</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:14.330" end="00:20.960">It's not quite the same without you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:20.960" end="00:23.480" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:23.480" end="00:25.550">Private allotments</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:25.550" end="00:32.650">Befriending the insects in here</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:32.650" end="00:39.600">Going insane like you want me to</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.600" end="00:44.290">If it's only love, it's only you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:44.290" end="00:48.820">If you were the one, I've had a few</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.820" end="00:56.820">It's only love, it's nothing new anymore</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:57.680" end="01:02.150">If it's only love, it's only time</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:02.150" end="01:06.620">'Til it all comes down and you're not mine</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:06.620" end="01:14.560">It's only love, I've fallen here before</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:14.560" end="01:22.560" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:26.310" end="01:28.120">I hate to swallow</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:28.120" end="01:34.890">The pride you bestowed on me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:34.890" end="01:42.890">But I haven't a clue, what else did you leave?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:43.870" end="01:46.350">There's nothing to borrow</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:46.350" end="01:52.540">Or worth it for me to keep</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:52.540" end="02:00.310">So I clear out your things until I feel clean</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:00.310" end="02:04.850">If it's only love, it's only you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:04.850" end="02:09.410">If you were the one, I've had a few</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:09.410" end="02:17.410">It's only love, it's nothing new anymore</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:18.380" end="02:22.860">If it's only love, it's only time</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:22.860" end="02:27.490">'Til it all comes down and you're not mine</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:27.490" end="02:35.450">It's only love, I've fallen here before</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:35.450" end="02:38.440" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:38.440" end="02:43.080">You say something</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:43.080" end="02:45.420">When you say nothing</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:45.420" end="02:53.420">I find myself when I see your face in the mirror</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:54.010" end="02:56.650" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:56.650" end="03:00.760">You say something</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:00.760" end="03:03.710">When you say nothing</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:03.710" end="03:07.710">I find myself when I see your face in the mirror</p></div></body></tt>